  abstract = {We present a structured interior-point method for the e cient solution of the optimal control problem in model predictive control (MPC). The cost of this approach is linear in the horizon length, compared with cubic growth for a naive approach. We use a discrete-time Riccati recursion to solve the linear equations e ciently at each iteration of the interior-point method, and show that this recursion is numerically stable. We demonstrate the e ectiveness of the approach by applying it to three process control problems.},
